From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charlie <5764343+charlielye@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 14:39:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(foundation): bump supertest to 7.1 for Node 26

On Node 26, supertest 6 resets the second of two concurrent requests
(read ECONNRESET), which fails the manual batching tests in
safe_json_rpc_client.test.ts. supertest 7.1.0 and later handle it, on
Node 24 as well.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G5s7nEWrYapDK2CWpEzcAf

